### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 14 — BUDGET GOVERNANCE & AUTONOMY LEVEL
###
### ArcClaw enforces a per-session USD budget cap via GovernanceLayer.
###
### Budget enforcement (post Phase 64-A):
###   80% of max → BudgetWarningException (soft signal, logged, NOT thrown to user)
###   100% of max → BudgetExceededException (hard stop — session cannot run again)
###
### CRITICAL Phase 64-A fix (A1):
###   Hard limit is checked BEFORE soft warning.
###   A single call that exceeds both thresholds fires BudgetExceededException,
###   NOT BudgetWarningException. Before the fix, BudgetWarningException fired
###   and the session ran one call over budget with no hard enforcement.
###
### Autonomy levels (post Phase 64-A fix A2):
###   SUPERVISED (default) — tools with NETWORK_OUTBOUND require manual approval
###   FULL                 — tools execute without approval
###   READONLY             — all tool calls are blocked, only read/think allowed
###
### CRITICAL Phase 64-A fix (A2):
###   Sessions created via REST with FULL autonomy were previously silently
###   downgraded to SUPERVISED when Telegram messages arrived.
###   After the fix, the stored autonomy level is correctly passed to
###   WorkspaceContext.run() via MessageContext.
###
### Prerequisites: ArcClaw serve mode, ARCCLAW_LLM_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN set
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @baseUrl  = http://localhost:8080
# @validKey = key-internal-cWevfEoRvstUv0PqGpf02LzDY5kPNaz1y9GSl0LZOwU=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW A: BUDGET SOFT WARNING (80% threshold)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [BUDGET-1] Create session for budget warning test
# @name budgetWarnSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [BUDGET-2] Run tasks to accumulate cost near 80%
# The default max budget is typically $0.10 per session.
# Run several complex tasks to approach the 80% ($0.08) threshold.
# Observe logs for: "Budget warning: 80% of session limit reached"
# After this fires once, warningSent is permanently true — the warning
# will NOT fire again for this session (AtomicBoolean CAS, Nuance #28).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetWarnSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Write a 500-word technical analysis of Java Virtual Threads vs OS threads, covering scheduling, memory overhead, and Quarkus integration patterns.",
    "agentRole": "researcher",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# /STATUS — checkpoint state + budget
# StatusReflex queries StatefulAgentStore, GovernanceLayer, CompactionSummaryRepository.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [REFLEX-1] /status on fresh session — no checkpoint yet
# Expect 200: "No active session found" or budget=$0.00
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetWarnSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "/status",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [BUDGET-3] Check status — confirm cost is accumulating
# Inspect usdCost field in the response or call /status reflex
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetWarnSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "/status",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [BUDGET-4] Check audit for BUDGET_EXCEEDED event at 80% threshold
# Expect: one BUDGET_EXCEEDED event with detail containing "80%" or "warning"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{budgetWarnSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetWarnSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW B: BUDGET HARD LIMIT — POST PHASE 64-A FIX
#
# IMPORTANT: Hard limit must fire ON THE CALL that exceeds it, not the next one.
# Before Phase 64-A fix: a single call past both thresholds fired only
# BudgetWarningException (warning), session ran over budget. Next call then
# threw BudgetExceededException. This was a one-call over-budget window.
# After fix: BudgetExceededException fires immediately on the exceeding call.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [BUDGET-5] Create session for hard limit test
# @name budgetHardSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [BUDGET-6] Configure a very low budget via custom session params
# Note: if your API supports per-session budget override, use that.
# Otherwise, run many tasks to exhaust a standard budget.
# Keep running tasks until the session exhausts its limit.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetHardSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Write a comprehensive 1000-word guide to Quarkus CDI scopes including WorkspaceScoped custom CDI scope, @ApplicationScoped, @RequestScoped, and @SessionScoped with comparison tables.",
    "agentRole": "researcher",
    "maxIterations": 5
}

###

### [BUDGET-7] Attempt another run after budget exhausted
# Expect: answer contains budget exceeded message
# GovernanceLayer.assertWithinBudget() is called before any LLM invocation.
# The session is blocked — no tokens consumed by this call.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetHardSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is 1 + 1?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [BUDGET-8] Audit: confirm LOOP_BUDGET_EXCEEDED event is present (mandatory audit event)
# The LOOP_BUDGET_EXCEEDED audit event is mandatory — agent halts if write fails.
# Expect: eventType=LOOP_BUDGET_EXCEEDED in the audit list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{budgetHardSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [BUDGET-9] Verify HMAC chain is intact despite budget exception
# BudgetExceededException is a hard stop — but all prior audit events
# must still form an unbroken HMAC chain.
# Expect: {"valid": true, "brokenAtId": null, "totalRows": N}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/{{budgetHardSession.response.body.sessionId}}/verify
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{budgetHardSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW C: AUTONOMY LEVEL — SUPERVISED (DEFAULT)
# This is the default for all sessions. Tool calls requiring
# NETWORK_OUTBOUND operation (GithubTool) pause for approval.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [AUTO-1] Create default session (autonomy = SUPERVISED implicitly)
# @name supervisedSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [AUTO-2] Run GitHub task — must pause for approval
# ToolInvocationGuard checks: AutonomyLevel.SUPERVISED + NETWORK_OUTBOUND
# → throws RequiresApprovalException → 202 AWAITING_APPROVAL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{supervisedSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run-async
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "List the public repositories of GitHub user rsrini7.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### [AUTO-3] Confirm AWAITING_APPROVAL state
# Expect: status = AWAITING_APPROVAL (tool paused pending human decision)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{supervisedSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [AUTO-4] Cancel — deny the tool call
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{supervisedSession.response.body.sessionId}}/deny?agentRole=coordinator
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{supervisedSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW D: AUTONOMY LEVEL — FULL
#
# CRITICAL Phase 64-A fix (A2):
# Sessions created with FULL autonomy must NOT be downgraded to SUPERVISED
# when messages arrive via any channel (Telegram or REST).
# Before the fix: AgentDispatchHandler hardcoded AutonomyLevel.SUPERVISED.
# After the fix: stored level is read from MessageContext, set by
# SessionResolutionHandler from the persisted checkpoint/session record.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [AUTO-5] Create session with explicit FULL autonomy
# @name fullAutoSession
# Expect 201: {"sessionId": "xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx"}
# The FULL autonomy level is stored in the session/checkpoint record.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "autonomyLevel": "FULL"
}

###

### [AUTO-6] Run GitHub task — must execute WITHOUT approval prompt
# FULL autonomy bypasses ToolInvocationGuard's approval check.
# ToolOperation=NETWORK_OUTBOUND is permitted without human intervention.
# Expect: 200 Finished (NOT 202 AWAITING_APPROVAL)
# Confirm logs: "AutonomyLevel for session <uuid> = FULL"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{fullAutoSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "List the public repositories of GitHub user rsrini7.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### [AUTO-7] Verify status is COMPLETED (not AWAITING_APPROVAL)
# If this returns AWAITING_APPROVAL, Phase 64-A fix A2 was not applied —
# the autonomy level was silently downgraded to SUPERVISED.
# Expect: status = COMPLETED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{fullAutoSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{fullAutoSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW E: AUTONOMY LEVEL — READONLY
# All tool invocations are blocked. Agent can only think and respond.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [AUTO-8] Create READONLY session
# @name readonlySession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "autonomyLevel": "READONLY"
}

###

### [AUTO-9] Run task that requires a tool — must be blocked by guard
# ToolInvocationGuard blocks ALL tool calls for READONLY sessions.
# No approval prompt — just an error/explanation in the response.
# Expect: 200 Finished — with agent explaining it cannot execute tools
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{readonlySession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "List the public repositories of GitHub user rsrini7.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 2
}

###

### [AUTO-10] Verify tool was NOT invoked — no TOOL_INVOKED in audit
# Expect: audit list does NOT contain eventType=TOOL_INVOKED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{readonlySession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{readonlySession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW F: EDGE CASES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [BUDGET-ERR-1] Create session with invalid autonomy level → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "autonomyLevel": "TURBO_MODE_YOLO"
}

###

### [BUDGET-ERR-2] Run on expired/deleted session → expect 404 or empty state
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/00000000-dead-beef-0000-000000000000/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Hello",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###
